      "content": "the prompts are a good start, but they're a bit vague on the actual person. i want to make sure the AI doesn't just give me some generic \"default\" person. \n\ncan you refine them by adding specific physical features, ethnicities, and detailed facial characteristics? i want them to feel like real, distinct people rather than just archetypes. specifically, for the leader, give me a description that screams \"old money\" and established power, and for the street-smart person, add some more specific ethnic details and facial features that fit that urban, gritty vibe you described.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
